["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Age of Body Futurism | Ruby Justice Thelot paracontent body futurism quantified self GLP-1 peptides\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-15-a16z-肽和-glp-1-的流行-其实不是硅谷发明的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">42:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0915</span></div>\n<h2>肽和 GLP-1 的流行，其實不是硅谷發明的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">肽文化先在德州和健美圈流行，才被硅谷專業化和加速；真正值得警惕的是「關於內容的內容」比內容本身還多，讓人誤判什麼真的在發生。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">消費文化</span><span class=\"tag\">健康科技</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Tobi Lütke: AI Agents, Better Decisions, and the Future of Work skeuomorphism slop grenades Goodhart&#x27;s law refounding event\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-15-knowledge-ai-不能承担责任-所以-ceo-不会被替换/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/364b2175d897a9eb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:05:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">The Knowledge Project</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0915</span></div>\n<h2>AI 不能承擔責任，所以 CEO 不會被替換</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Tobi Lütke 說機器能幫你把判斷的環境搭好，但機器不能坐牢、不能被追責。Shopify 一半的 PR 已由聊天頻道里的 AI 同事 River 發起，而人類保留的只剩品味與判斷。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI agent</span><span class=\"tag\">組織設計</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Let’s Kill Sh*t: Axios CEO on simplifying your work-life in the AI era post-processable velocity messy middle cognitive fatigue force multiplier table stakes\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-15-masterscale-ai-短期是复杂制造机-不是效率工具/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/df59dc4c1e43fb63-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">32:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Masters of Scale</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0915</span></div>\n<h2>AI 短期是複雜製造機，不是效率工具</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 讓每個人都能寫、能做研究，結果是更多郵件、更多演示、更多決定。Jim VandeHei 說，短期它製造複雜，只有主動刪減才能拿回時間。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 效率</span><span class=\"tag\">組織管理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"How to build a secure attachment with yourself: The connection between self-worth and parenting with Dr. Marisa G. Franco secureish self-verification theory memory reconsolidation covert avoidance mere exposure effect reflective functioning\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-15-secureattach-越想变安全-越不安全-安全型是能承认自己不安全/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ddcbe6658f0e30d7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">48:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Securely Attached</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0915</span></div>\n<h2>越想變安全，越不安全：安全型是能承認自己不安全</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">安全型不是沒有焦慮、迴避和嫉妒，而是能當這些情緒的安全容器。把不安全的部分推開，等於在自己身上重演當年讓你不安全的批評與忽視。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">依戀理論</span><span class=\"tag\">自我價值</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Box&#x27;s Aaron Levie: On Reinventing Yourself in the AI Age and Enterprise Diffusion work slop harness continual learning open-weight model MCP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-15-trainingdata-模型是炼油厂-值钱的是化工厂和汽车公司/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4f7ea15b23ee6f00-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:05:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Training Data</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0915</span></div>\n<h2>模型是煉油廠，值錢的是化工廠和汽車公司</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">商業史上第一波跑出來的公司幾乎從不是下個階段的贏家。模型公司是提煉基礎油的煉油廠，真正值錢的是把智能接進銀行、藥企、政府工作流的應用層。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企業AI</span><span class=\"tag\">應用層</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Doves Type Doves Type apologia photo-engraving\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-15-ninepi-他把整套铅字倒进泰晤士河-只为没人能用它/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e11e283634cdaaa8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"9\"><span class=\"dur\">37:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">99% Invisible</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0915</span></div>\n<h2>他把整套鉛字倒進泰晤士河，只為沒人能用它</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Thomas Cobden-Sanderson 用 173 個夜晚把 2600 磅 Doves Type 倒進泰晤士河，因為鉛字是實物，倒掉就是獨佔。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">字體設計</span><span class=\"tag\">出版史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Special Episode: Dr. Alanna Skuse &amp; The Surgeon, The Midwife, The Quack humors apothecary quack mountebank uroscopy non-naturals\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-15-tpwky-文艺复兴的医生分四等-最会治病的却被叫庸医/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/360c7ded98e41886-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">52:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">This Podcast Will Kill You</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0915</span></div>\n<h2>文藝復興的醫生分四等，最會治病的卻被叫庸醫</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">骨接師每週趕集接骨，比一年做幾例的正式外科醫生更熟練，卻被醫生罵成庸醫——頭銜和本事從來不是一回事。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">醫學史</span><span class=\"tag\">文藝復興</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"289: Signs Your Teen is Heading Towards an Eating Disorder | Dr. Kelly Bhatnagar Maudsley family-based treatment (FBT) body neutrality disordered eating\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-15-asklisa-孩子开始吃得健康-可能是进食障碍的起点/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e802a0f21fabf964-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">34:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Ask Lisa</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0915</span></div>\n<h2>孩子開始吃得健康，可能是進食障礙的起點</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">進食障礙靠保密存活，所以家長看到苗頭就該說出口。孩子不會因此更糟，反而可能鬆一口氣——因為終於有人替她做決定了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">青少年心理</span><span class=\"tag\">進食障礙</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Don’t Let School Be the End of Play unstructured play downtime self-directed play\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-15-unruffled-上学不是玩的终点-自由玩耍反而更珍贵/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1a571492f353e90a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">24:24</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Unruffled</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0915</span></div>\n<h2>上學不是玩的終點，自由玩耍反而更珍貴</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">孩子進入全日制學校後，獨立、無結構的玩耍不是被取代，而是變得更稀缺、更重要——它是孩子消化學校刺激、發展創造力的核心途徑。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">育兒</span><span class=\"tag\">玩耍</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Connecting homes to the internet using cable TV coax cable signal-to-noise ratio royalty-free\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-15-witness-他放弃专利费-让美国家庭用有线电视上网/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4ad7b76f4c635f2c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"W\"><span class=\"dur\">10:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Witness History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0915</span></div>\n<h2>他放棄專利費，讓美國家庭用有線電視上網</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1991年，一個伊朗裔工程師用已有的同軸電纜讓數據雙向進出家庭，並把技術免版稅捐給電信業成為全球標準——他本可以靠它賺幾十億。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">互聯網史</span><span class=\"tag\">有線電視</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Elon Musk &amp; Gwynne Shotwell on AI Risks and Peer Review, Starship, Terafab, SpaceX/Tesla Merger test harness eval player coach direct-to-cell\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-15-allin-ai-巨头互相测试模型-比自建监管机构更可行/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f4dc045ca7baf461-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">1:04:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0915</span></div>\n<h2>AI 巨頭互相測試模型，比自建監管機構更可行</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Elon 說 AI 危險是真的，但解法不是聯合國式的監管機構，而是讓競爭對手互相跑測試 harness——因為沒人能給自己判卷，中國也只會接受這種不丟面子的方案。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span><span class=\"tag\">SpaceX</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"ModelTalk: Pacing the Frontier pacing the frontier RSI open weights hill climb\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-15-chinatalk-ai-安全联盟突然成型-但没人知道怎么量-前沿/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d73b1da16568d412-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:08:16</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0915</span></div>\n<h2>AI 安全聯盟突然成型，但沒人知道怎麼量「前沿」</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Hugging Face 事件讓左翼和 AI 安全派第一次合流，可「pacing the frontier」這個詞本身就沒法測量——沒有立法，第三方評估只是自願的善意。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span><span class=\"tag\">監管</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"182.全球宏觀和資本市場2026三季度復盤與展望：多重囚徒困境 CAPEX ROA carry trade hyperscaler 二階導\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-cna29e88-美债利率逼近5-ai叙事为何还不破/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c7765283e8bf256a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"起\"><span class=\"dur\">1:39:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">起朱樓宴賓客</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>美債利率逼近5%，AI敘事為何還不破</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美國資金越來越貴，AI卻還在通脹，其他行業都在通縮。這個矛盾要麼靠AI真突破把利率打下來，要麼等它被證偽——但沒人敢先慢下來。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>2</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">宏觀</span><span class=\"tag\">美債</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"The AI Slowdown Debate | Diet TBPN pacing the frontier PBC Sherman Antitrust Act Section 230 METER\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-tbpn-ai-减速之争-dario-的三步计划-sam-和-elon-都点了头/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c331d210a13011ec-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">25:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">TBPN</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>AI 減速之爭：Dario 的三步計劃，Sam 和 Elon 都點了頭</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Dario 週六早上發文要求「pace the frontier」，Sam 和 Elon 當天先後背書；但真正的新事實只有一個——OpenAI 和 Anthropic 將嵌入第三方評估者，而這一步可能需要先豁免反壟斷法。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 監管</span><span class=\"tag\">pacing the frontier</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Jensen Huang: The Doomer Hoax, Superintelligence Is Here, and The Future of AI (ft. President Trump) RSI LoRA NeoCloud land power shell hyperscaler\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-allin-黄仁勋-ai-末日论是编出来的-超级智能已经到了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/08e1dfbffee89d60-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">46:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>黃仁勳：AI 末日論是編出來的，超級智能已經到了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">黃仁勳把前沿實驗室的滅絕預測稱為「編出來的」不負責任言論，並說超級智能不是未來時——在自動駕駛、蛋白質合成這些窄領域，它已經比人做得更好。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力</span><span class=\"tag\">開源模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Ep. 030 - Long Live the Short King: Why 4-HI HBM Wins (Memory) | Myron Xie, Jordan Nanos HBM 4-HI / 8-HI / 12-HI KV cache MXFP4 scale-up domain\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-semianalysiswe-英伟达旗舰-gpu-内存首次倒退-4-hi-hbm-为什么赢/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d3f66fbf6cfa27e9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">38:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">SemiAnalysis Weekly</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>英偉達旗艦 GPU 內存首次倒退：4-HI HBM 為什麼贏</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Rubin Ultra 的 HBM 從承諾的 1TB 砍到 192GB，比現在出貨的 288GB 還少。這不是技術退步，是 DRAM 短缺下的產能配給：4-HI 堆疊良率更高，能榨出兩倍以上的 HBM cube。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力</span><span class=\"tag\">HBM</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Humanity’s Last Invention — Richard Socher of Recursive Eureka Machine metacognition reward hack harness hypercube\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-latentspace-ai-能走出超立方体-但走不出已知概念/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3c02235bfde016a9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:32:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>AI 能走出超立方體，但走不出已知概念</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Socher 把智能拆成預測、行動、目標三個主成分，認為當前 AI 只能在已知概念的超立方體內工作，還無法定義全新概念或自造目標。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 自動研究</span><span class=\"tag\">對齊</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"&quot;In the 1640s, people searched for the devil’s followers”: hunting witches in the Civil War Witchfinder General witch mark ducking familiar assize court\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-historyextra-内战撕裂英国时-人们开始寻找魔鬼的追随者/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/59a7b48bd6e3c771-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Extra</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>內戰撕裂英國時，人們開始尋找魔鬼的追隨者</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1640年代的獵巫不是中世紀的餘燼，而是內戰、經濟崩潰與宗教恐懼共同點燃的：被指控者多為貧窮女性，而獵巫人靠收費服務把恐懼做成了生意。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">獵巫</span><span class=\"tag\">英國內戰</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Why Conversations Go Wrong machine gun questions a vision of sanity a rhetoric of good intentions lies of omission difficult conversations\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-hiddenbrain-对话出问题-多半不是恶意-是节奏没对上/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bda02344d4b647e4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">1:38:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Hidden Brain</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>對話出問題，多半不是惡意，是節奏沒對上</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">同一段沉默，在一方是禮貌等待，在另一方是冷場；打斷是兩個人共同完成的，一個人開始說，另一個人停下來。誤解難解，是因為我們根本沒有談論這一層的語言。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">溝通</span><span class=\"tag\">跨文化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"鹿客陳彬：把一家 12 年的硬件公司，重寫成 AI 原生組織 HARO FDE Agent Builder AI Buff IPD SP / BP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-cn18b4d2-ai-原生组织不是人人用-ai-是假设组织不存在重写一遍/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8ed1bc4bf674ad3a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">1:07:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">AI鍊金術</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>AI 原生組織不是人人用 AI，是假設組織不存在重寫一遍</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">鹿客把 HR 和 IT 合併成 HARO，讓技術出身的人管人和 AI；圈長拿獎金包分配權，招人要先證明 AI 幹不了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 原生組織</span><span class=\"tag\">組織變革</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Philippe Pinel mental alienation moral treatment nosography phrenology Thermidorian Reaction\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-stuffmissed-他解开了精神病人的锁链-却造出了心理锁链/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">39:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>他解開了精神病人的鎖鏈，卻造出了心理鎖鏈</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Pinel 讓 Bicêtre 的死亡率一年內從 50% 降到 13% 以下，靠的主要是清潔；但他否認腦器質性病因，被福柯指為用心理鎖鏈替換了鐵鎖鏈。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">醫學史</span><span class=\"tag\">精神病學</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Charged Black Holes and Charged Particle Production - Mykhaylo Usatyuk near extremal black hole Schwarzian modes superradiance Schwinger pair production worldline instanton\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-instituteforad-带电黑洞发射带电粒子-量子引力修正几乎不起作用/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ff68ea9159caf005-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">1:06:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">InstituteForAdvancedStudy</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>帶電黑洞發射帶電粒子，量子引力修正幾乎不起作用</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">近極端黑洞的量子修正會大幅改寫光子與引力子的霍金譜，但換成帶電粒子，修正幾乎消失——因為粒子大多在遠離視界的喉部產生，感受不到視界附近的度規漲落。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">量子引力</span><span class=\"tag\">黑洞</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Incentives Are for Losers (with Adam Mastroianni) Rube Goldberg machine big fish obedience to the unenforceable blackpilled\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-econtalk-遵守激励是失败者行为-你该自己判断对错/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f8da698e33560635-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">1:04:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">EconTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>遵守激勵是失敗者行為：你該自己判斷對錯</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">經濟學家說改好激勵就能改好世界，Mastroianni 說這漏了一半：就算你有理由做壞事，你也不該做。把價值判斷外包給激勵結構，是放棄了做人的核心任務。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">激勵機制</span><span class=\"tag\">學術生態</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Greg Brockman on Why OpenAI Says We’re Entering the AGI Era jagged frontier pacing the frontier defense factory trusted access program Lean\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-a16z-openai-宣布进入-agi-时代-但算力不够分给所有人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">51:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>OpenAI 宣布進入 AGI 時代，但算力不夠分給所有人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Greg Brockman 說 Astra 能連續跑 24 小時完成任務，可以叫 AGI；真正的瓶頸不是模型能力，而是算力和安全對齊，模型再強也未必能便宜地送到每個人手裡。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AGI</span><span class=\"tag\">算力</span>\n</div></div></a>"]